From: Hans Bihs <hans.bihs@ntnu.no>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 06:28:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 0: foundations of the LAGOON application

- lagoonviz (GPLv3): Qt-free core with scene, item kinds, undoable
  commands, sessions and script recorder; PySide6 main window with
  scene tree, viewport placeholder, properties, plots placeholder,
  timeline and Python console
- lagoon-format (MIT): format package with specification stub
- Tests for core and GUI (offscreen), headless replay test
- import-linter layer rules, ruff, GitHub Actions on macOS, Linux
  and Windows, pixi environment, VS Code workspace

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WDppjnLRKbz8eRzfm9c1r6
